zh-CN.readError:
无法读取或安全处理以下配置文件：
{{file}}

请检查文件权限、占用情况及路径后重新启动。文件未被删除，客户端将退出。

zh-CN.deleteError:
未能删除以下配置文件：
{{file}}

文件可能在确认后发生变化，或无法访问。请自行检查处理，客户端将退出。

zh-CN.repairError:
未能安全修复以下配置文件：
{{file}}

文件可能在确认后发生变化，或无法访问。原文件或同目录的 before-repair 备份已保留，请检查后重新启动。

en-US.readError:
This configuration file could not be read or safely accessed:
{{file}}

Check its permissions, whether it is in use, and its path before restarting. The file was not deleted. Jeemi will exit.

en-US.deleteError:
This configuration file could not be deleted:
{{file}}

It may have changed after confirmation or become inaccessible. Check the file manually. Jeemi will exit.

en-US.repairError:
This configuration file could not be repaired safely:
{{file}}

It may have changed after confirmation or become inaccessible. The original file or a before-repair backup in the same folder has been kept. Check it before restarting.
